msgid "Frequently Asked Questions and Issues"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:5
#: 5e2ed1cc3d284e36ab238839b893b2d1
msgid "I have random \"noise\" displaying on the console, showing as corrupted text. How do I remove it?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:7
#: fb245f49ad4d44569c8eeba7729d2b95
msgid "MAVProxy will, by default, show corrupted packets. To disable showing them, use ``set shownoise false`` in the MAVProxy console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:11
#: cb635531749547d0aa10675731045f27
msgid "How do I get MAVProxy to execute specific commands on startup?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:13
#: af8b0b20bd604d0cb013ad7ebe3a6ffb
msgid "Put the commands in mavinit.scr as per :ref:`here <mavproxy-mavinit>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:16
#: 3045ac8fd490453c97b82ee235dac5aa
msgid "Which Flight controllers are compatible with MAVProxy?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:18
#: b3dd8abe153d47de905fe5c5687be789
msgid "The ArduPilot vehicle types (:ref:`ArduPlane <plane:home>`, :ref:`ArduCopter <copter:home>`, :ref:`ArduSub <sub:home>` and :ref:`ArduRover <rover:home>`) are fully compatible. Other Mavlink-based flight controllers (such as the `PX4 <https://px4.io/>`_ stack) should be compatible, but may not show all flight data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:21
#: b5c54238fdd04aa391aa42c958e25702
msgid "How do I output a TCP connection to another GCS program?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:23
#: 30d6c9bae9934c12bae0f259b32b2830
msgid "To output a TCP link from MAVProxy to a GCS program (ie. Mission Planner), use the ``--out=tcpin:0.0.0.0:<port>`` commandline option. This will tell MAVProxy to wait for a TCP connection on the specified port. In the other GCS program, configure it to point to the IP address of the device MAVProxy is running on and the port ``<port>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:25
#: b59ec79a550d4b5d811bbd84c4521211
msgid "How do I disable other GCS sub-clients (from ``--out``) from sending commands to the flight controller?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/faq.rst:27
#: 7b1bf16fe02945c5a719c82a355d2551
msgid "The ability to forward commands sent by other sub-clients is enabled by default. It can be disabled by typing ``set mavfwd false``"
msgstr ""
